# A PINNED container image for sealed proof runs (prefer a digest:
#   node:22-bookworm@sha256:...). When present and a runtime is available,
# proof.sh runs the architect's proof script inside a disposable container with
# a clean HOME and the network DISABLED — which is what makes DUO_NO_NETWORK
# enforcement rather than advice. Full/lightweight projects may leave this
# empty to use the honestly reported host tier. Production requires a
# digest-pinned value plus a working runtime and refuses host fallback.
